@PlanningApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5022
@actorId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### 1. Master Data: Countries (Pagination supported)
GET {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/countries?page=0&pageSize=10

### 2. Master Data: Create Country
POST {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/countries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isoCode": "VN",
  "name": "Vietnam",
  "active": true
}

### 3. Master Data: Locations
GET {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/locations?page=0&pageSize=10

### 4. Master Data: Vehicles
GET {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vehicles?page=0&pageSize=10

### 5. Master Data: Create Vehicle
POST {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleCode": "VHC-001",
  "plateNumber": "51H-123.45",
  "vehicleType": "HORSE_TRUCK",
  "horseCapacity": 6,
  "stallCapacity": 6,
  "temperatureControlled": true,
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

### 6. Master Data: Stalls
GET {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/stalls?page=0&pageSize=10

### 7. Master Data: Airlines
GET {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/airlines?page=0&pageSize=10

### 8. Master Data: Flight Bookings
GET {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/flight-bookings?page=0&pageSize=10

### 9. Availability Queries (T09)
GET {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/availability/vehicles?vehicleId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001&from=2026-10-20T02:00:00Z&to=2026-10-20T08:00:00Z

###
GET {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/availability/stalls?stallId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001&from=2026-10-20T02:00:00Z&to=2026-10-20T08:00:00Z

###
GET {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/availability/flights?flightBookingId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001&from=2026-10-20T02:00:00Z&to=2026-10-20T08:00:00Z

### 10. Trip Creation (T10 - Idempotent by orderId)
POST {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/trips
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222"
}

### 11. Create Route Plan
POST {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/route-plans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actorUserId": "{{actorId}}"
}

### 12. Get Route Plan Versions
GET {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/route-plans/{{routePlanId}}/versions

### 13. Add Route Leg (Only when version is DRAFT)
POST {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/route-plan-versions/{{routePlanVersionId}}/legs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sequenceNo": 1,
  "originLocationId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "destinationLocationId": "44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444",
  "mode": "ROAD",
  "departureAt": "2026-10-20T02:00:00Z",
  "arrivalAt": "2026-10-20T08:00:00Z",
  "distanceKm": 150.5
}

### 14. Get Route Legs of Version
GET {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/route-plan-versions/{{routePlanVersionId}}/legs

### 15. Add Checkpoint to Leg
POST {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/route-legs/{{routeLegId}}/checkpoints
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sequenceNo": 1,
  "locationId": "55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555",
  "type": "REST_STOP",
  "arrivalAt": "2026-10-20T04:00:00Z",
  "departureAt": "2026-10-20T04:30:00Z"
}

### 16. Assign Resource to Route Leg
POST {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/route-legs/{{routeLegId}}/assignments/resource
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "flightBookingId": null,
  "assignedByUserId": "{{actorId}}"
}

### 17. Assign Staff (Driver or Escort) to Trip
POST {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/staff-assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "legId": "{{routeLegId}}",
  "userId": "{{actorId}}",
  "role": "ESCORT"
}

### 18. Assign Horse and Stall to Trip
POST {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/horse-assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "horseId": "66666666-6666-6666-6666-666666666666",
  "legId": "{{routeLegId}}",
  "stallId": "{{stallId}}"
}

### 19. Submit Route Plan Version (DRAFT -> PENDING_APPROVAL)
POST {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/route-plan-versions/{{routePlanVersionId}}/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actorUserId": "{{actorId}}"
}

### 20. Approve Route Plan Version (PENDING_APPROVAL -> APPROVED)
POST {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/route-plan-versions/{{routePlanVersionId}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actorUserId": "{{actorId}}"
}

### 21. Activate Route Plan Version (APPROVED -> ACTIVE)
POST {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/route-plan-versions/{{routePlanVersionId}}/activate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actorUserId": "{{actorId}}"
}

### 22. Compliance Ready Event (T11)
POST {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/compliance-ready

### 23. Check Trip Readiness and Blockers (T11)
GET {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/readiness

### 24. Confirm Trip Ready (T11 - transitions to READY, publishes Planning.TripReady)
POST {{PlanningApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/trips/{{tripId}}/confirm-ready
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actorUserId": "{{actorId}}"
}
